      "line": 25986,
      "source": "Activate the infusion to increase movement speed by %d%% for 1 game turn.\n\t\tYou gain 100%% stun, daze, and pin immunity during the effect.\n\t\tAny actions other than movement will cancel the effect.\n\t\tNote: since you will be moving very fast, game turns will pass very slowly.",
      "target": "激活这个纹身可以在 1 个游戏回合内提升移动速度 %d%%。\n\t\t同时获得 100%% 眩晕、震慑和定身免疫。\n\t\t除移动以外其他动作会取消这个效果。\n\t\t注意：由于你的速度非常快，游戏回合会相对很慢。",
      "source_tag": "tformat",
      "revision_id": "8dd6dcd1087c3636ba32704b58e76bc75acbcac4520497daacd09d31a2438651",
